### Variables
@baseUrl = http://127.0.0.1:8000
@email = judge_demo_01@versathon.com
@password = secret123

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### AUTHENTICATION
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 1. Register User
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "Judge Demo",
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### 2. Login (Capture Token & KYC ID)
# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "{{email}}",
  "password": "{{password}}"
}

### Set Variables from Login Response
@authToken = {{login.response.body.access_token}}
@kyc_id = {{login.response.body.kyc_id}}

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### KYC UPLOAD FLOW
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 3. Upload ID Card
# Ensure 'sample_id.jpg' exists in the same folder as this file
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/upload-id?kyc_id={{kyc_id}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJqdWRnZV9kZW1vXzAxQHZlcnNhdGhvbi5jb20iLCJleHAiOjE3NzExNTMwOTV9.hAJ7yx8Zx0r_oCQoa3GoBPpIgOiXL7xEnmwP43IAvPI
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary123

--boundary123
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_id.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

 < ./sample_id.png
--boundary123--

### 4. Upload Selfie
# Ensure 'sample_selfie.jpg' exists in the same folder as this file
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/upload-selfie?kyc_id={{kyc_id}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJqdWRnZV9kZW1vXzAxQHZlcnNhdGhvbi5jb20iLCJleHAiOjE3NzExNTMwOTV9.hAJ7yx8Zx0r_oCQoa3GoBPpIgOiXL7xEnmwP43IAvPI
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary456

--boundary456
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="sample_selfie.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./sample_selfie.jpg
--boundary456--

### ------------------------------------------------------------
### VERIFICATION & RESULTS
### ------------------------------------------------------------

### 5. Run AI Verification
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/verify?kyc_id={{kyc_id}}
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJqdWRnZV9kZW1vXzAxQHZlcnNhdGhvbi5jb20iLCJleHAiOjE3NzExNTMwOTV9.hAJ7yx8Zx0r_oCQoa3GoBPpIgOiXL7xEnmwP43IAvPI

### 6. Get Result
GET {{baseUrl}}/kyc/result?kyc_id={{kyc_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 7. Generate PDF Report
POST {{baseUrl}}/kyc/generate-report?kyc_id={{kyc_id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}

### 8. Health Check
GET {{baseUrl}}/health